==========================================================
LeetCode SQL 50

Problem Number : 1757
Problem Name   : Recyclable and Low Fat Products
Difficulty     : Easy

Problem Link   : https://leetcode.com/problems/recyclable-and-low-fat-products/

----------------------------------------------------------
Approach
----------------------------------------------------------
- Filter products that satisfy both conditions:
  1. low_fats = 'Y'
  2. recyclable = 'Y'
- Return only the product_id.

----------------------------------------------------------
Time Complexity : O(n)
Space Complexity: O(1)
==========================================================
Query:

SELECT
    product_id
FROM Products
WHERE low_fats = 'Y'
  AND recyclable = 'Y';
